          "content_text": "你好，我看这个地址，有些许疑问，9月4号16:50的CKB价格是0.001035 给启动款 项目启动 $2,500，2500除以0.001035 哪怕是0.001都是250万个CKB，为什么显示是287万个CKB呢？按照规范，应该是按照打款当日的汇率计算吧\nimage1280×714 108 KB\nimage1280×163 62.9 KB",
          "content_html": "<p>你好，我看这个地址，有些许疑问，9月4号16:50的CKB价格是0.001035 给启动款 项目启动 $2,500，2500除以0.001035 哪怕是0.001都是250万个CKB，为什么显示是287万个CKB呢？按照规范，应该是按照打款当日的汇率计算吧</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b05eaf5a76cad00b4b5c53b7f7390e2fa74d2cdb.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/b05eaf5a76cad00b4b5c53b7f7390e2fa74d2cdb\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b05eaf5a76cad00b4b5c53b7f7390e2fa74d2cdb_2_690x384.jpeg\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"paeTzQ6whs1QTaL2GiXjioNmusX\" width=\"690\" height=\"384\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b05eaf5a76cad00b4b5c53b7f7390e2fa74d2cdb_2_690x384.jpeg, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/b/b05eaf5a76cad00b4b5c53b7f7390e2fa74d2cdb_2_1035x576.jpeg 1.5x, https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/b/b05eaf5a76cad00b4b5c53b7f7390e2fa74d2cdb.jpeg 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"F3F4F4\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1280×714 108 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/original/2X/7/7e009fd541a4199d0e608a779d6ec113ec6701af.png\" data-download-href=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/7e009fd541a4199d0e608a779d6ec113ec6701af\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e009fd541a4199d0e608a779d6ec113ec6701af_2_690x87.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hYFuVUjb9RGkIRvMgkJeYyPcv2D\" width=\"690\" height=\"87\" srcset=\"https://talk.nervos.org/uploads/default/optimized/2X/7/7e009fd541a4199d0e608a779d6ec113ec6